[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313193427","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110696#issuecomment-3313193427","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110696","id":3313193427,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7Fe1HT","user":{"login":"ettiSurreal","id":98223724,"node_id":"U_kgDOBdrGbA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/98223724?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal","html_url":"https://github.com/ettiSurreal","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ettiSurreal/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T17:50:27Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T17:50:27Z","body":"Are the values sourced from somewhere or did you make everything yourself?\r\n\r\nMaybe a better idea if the documentation just linked to a website where values for different materials could be sourced from.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313193427/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313241024","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110696#issuecomment-3313241024","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110696","id":3313241024,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FfAvA","user":{"login":"me-steven","id":42823678,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODIzNjc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42823678?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven","html_url":"https://github.com/me-steven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T18:04:49Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T18:04:49Z","body":"Values are approximated by available information and then I used reference videos - creating meshes that approximated the size and mass of objects in the reference and testing values - to get better feeling materials.\r\n\r\nThere aren't very many complete tables that hold coefficient of frictions but some [tables do exist like this](https://www.engineersedge.com/coeffients_of_friction.htm). And even fewer for coefficient of restitution and you might need to look at [research papers](https://www.researchgate.net/figure/Experimental-results-for-restitution-coefficient-of-different-materials_tbl1_261215109).\r\n\r\nIt can be overwhelming if you want to start getting into the weeds and want to approximate something 'real'","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313241024/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313247288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110696#issuecomment-3313247288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110696","id":3313247288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FfCQ4","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T18:06:35Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T18:06:35Z","body":"But the values need to follow some kind of reasonable standard if we are to add them at all, for example what other engines might use for example","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313247288/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313382978","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110696#issuecomment-3313382978","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110696","id":3313382978,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7FfjZC","user":{"login":"me-steven","id":42823678,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyODIzNjc4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42823678?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven","html_url":"https://github.com/me-steven","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/me-steven/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-19T18:43:29Z","updated_at":"2025-09-19T18:43:29Z","body":"I don't disagree and think it should be based on something. \r\n\r\nAs far as I can tell engines like Unity, Unreal, and even Box2D don't have anything like this listed anywhere(or they aren't easily searchable - even in their documentation pages). Or they are incomplete and users have to search through multiple resources for two different values that aren't related to each other outside of the context of game dev.\r\n\r\nSo trying to point to a single reference wouldn't really be feasible unless someone created this table.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3313382978/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]